From: mscharged-port
Subject: Recharged's trophy room: the game's online menu waits
Upstream-base: 8b9d92dd88b4c727cc6359ee4cd5ba128cced7b8

Recharged's trophy room (src/platform/trophy_room.cpp) takes the front
end's camera from the game's online menu to the trophy of the game's cut
online tournament. The online menu stays on top of the scene stack, undrawn
(mscharged_tweak_menu_scene_hidden), and kept taking its players' buttons:
a press where RANKED was opened the RANKED screens from the trophy room.

A new hook, mscharged_tweak_online_menu_held, holds the menu at rest while
the room shows: SHOnlineHub::Update returns before its friends'
invitations, its rankings refresh and its buttons and Back. A set's walk
into its RANKED search (tweak patch 0056) and its way out after a lost
connection come before it and still go from the trophy room.

diff --git a/include/mscharged_tweaks.h b/include/mscharged_tweaks.h
--- a/include/mscharged_tweaks.h
+++ b/include/mscharged_tweaks.h
@@ -226,6 +226,10 @@
 bool mscharged_tweak_menu_press_taken(int menu, int button, int pad);
 // Once a frame (BeginFrameTask): what the host asked the game's menus to do.
 void mscharged_tweak_menus_frame(void);
+// The game's online menu, on top and at rest, waits: Recharged's trophy room
+// shows the front end's world in its place, and its buttons, its Back and
+// its friends' invitations do nothing meanwhile.
+bool mscharged_tweak_online_menu_held(void);
 // While the host draws the pause menu, a player's cursor (wiicursor.fen's
 // cursor0-3) is drawn by the host on top of it: the front end marks the
 // cursor's drawing (begin returns the state for end) and hands its pictures
